  "description": {
    "text": "The Water Modification Pack (水属性改造包) holds cards for improving the Water deck of the Battle Party Set. Its ten cards are Lapras, Articuno-GX, Suicune, Manaphy, Tapu Fini-GX, Palkia-GX, Escape Rope, Energy Retrieval, Lady and Lana.\n\nModification packs (改造包) arrived on 13 January 2024 with Battle Party modification battles (改造赛). Pokémon made one pack for each of the Battle Party Set's eight decks; each held four random cards from its own list of ten. A player got the pack for the deck they drew and could swap any of its cards into that deck. From the same day the 64-player Battle Party King tournaments used this format too. The packs were not in the box when the Battle Party Set went on sale in shops in February 2024."
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMPlC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 010"
  },
